{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_02_when_not_to_use_it_spread_accumulator_quadratic", "label": "Spreading the reduce accumulator is O(N\u00b2)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/02-when-not-to-use-it.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MDN anti-pattern: {...allNames, [name]: n} copies the whole object every iteration. Mutate the private accumulator or use for...of."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_02_when_not_to_use_it_reduce_replacements", "label": "Better-named methods than reduce", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/02-when-not-to-use-it.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "flat, Object.groupBy/Map.groupBy, flatMap, Array.from(new Set), find/some, filter. Grouping is the most common legitimate-looking misuse."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_02_when_not_to_use_it_object_groupby", "label": "Object.groupBy / Map.groupBy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/02-when-not-to-use-it.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prefer Map.groupBy \u2014 any key type and insertion order. Replaces the hand-written grouping reduce."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_05_reduce_02_when_not_to_use_it_pipe_via_reduce", "label": "pipe and asyncPipe via reduce", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/05-reduce/02-when-not-to-use-it.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fold over functi